---
description: Say what one edit of a value is for.
args:
  before: unknown
  after: unknown
returns: Intent
types:
  Intent: Is<string, "one sentence that names what the edit changes in the value's meaning and why">
---
after is before with one edit made to it. Say what the edit is for: what it changes in what the value means or does,
and what it keeps. Name the purpose of the change rather than the characters that differ.
